    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Craft Magic Elixirs and Potions</p></blockquote><p>An Alchemist is an expert at combining reagents to produce magical effects, using these creations to give life and to drain it away.</p><h3>Alchemist Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.9n6zX1Rc7yCSAjXE]{Tools of the Trade}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.gipp6i2SwxyssGeb]{Experimental Elixir}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.TcEKxTR79nhBNlaP]{Alchemical Savant}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.FIVybqjmv90Hx47C]{Restorative Reagents}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.tVW9xNPmK2TDwWcn]{Chemical Mastery}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Alchemist Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Artificer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHealingWor]{Healing Word}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRayofSickn]{Ray of Sickness}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFlamingSph]{Flaming Sphere}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMelfsAcidA]{Melf's Acid Arrow}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGaseousFor]{Gaseous Form}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassHealin]{Mass Healing Word}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDeathWard0]{Death Ward}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplVitriolicS]{Vitriolic Sphere}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCloudkill0]{Cloudkill}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRaiseDead0]{Raise Dead}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
